@startuml
title Flujo Promesa V3

actor Usuario
boundary "Cliente View\nform promesa" as View
boundary "Route\nclientes.promesas.store" as Route
control "PromesaController" as Controller
control "CreatePromesaAction" as CreateAction
control "PromesaPolicy" as Policy
control "PromesaCreationService" as Creation
control "PromesaScheduleService" as Schedule
entity "PromesaPago" as PromesaPago
entity "PromesaOperacion" as PromesaOperacion
entity "PromesaCuota" as PromesaCuota
control "PromesaWorkflowService" as Workflow
control "PromesaDocumentService" as Document
boundary "PromesaPdfController" as PdfController
folder "Storage DOCX/PDF" as Storage

Usuario -> View: crea promesa
View -> Route: POST
Route -> Controller: store(dni, request)
Controller -> CreateAction: execute()
CreateAction -> Policy: authorize create
CreateAction -> Creation: createFromRequest()
Creation -> Schedule: normalizar cronograma
Creation -> PromesaPago: crear cabecera
Creation -> PromesaOperacion: asociar operaciones
Creation -> PromesaCuota: crear cuotas
Creation -> Workflow: estado inicial por rol
Controller --> Usuario: redirect + mensaje

Usuario -> PdfController: descargar acuerdo
PdfController -> Document: agreementResponse()
Document -> PromesaPago: datos
Document -> PromesaOperacion: operaciones
Document -> PromesaCuota: cronograma
Document -> Storage: DOCX/PDF o fallback

@enduml
